  "objective": "Create summary artifacts with quantitative data tables",
  "rationale": "Organize the findings into clear tables for the user",
  "status": "completed",
  "result": "Created artifact-00 (detailed variability data table) and artifact-01 (qualification studies summary).",
  "evaluation": "Two comprehensive tables created."
}"}

